<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Lepanto H1 net jumps 44 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Lepanto H1 net jumps 44 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			175.5 vs 121.9</p>
<p>Note: Full name Lepanto Consolidated Mining Co. The firm said it made an operating income of 151.9 million pesos in the first six months of the year, of which 151.3 million came from its Victoria gold mine.</p>
